title: A video card in view must not cover the toolbar, go to file, the command palette, a notice, the canvas menu or Settings
folders: media
fixtures: plain

wait 3500
left none
right none
goto video/clip.mp4
wait 2500
mark toolbar
wait 500
quick lib
wait 800
mark go-to-file
wait 500
ui click 20 600
wait 400
palette canvas
wait 800
mark palette
wait 500
ui click 20 600
wait 400
workspace put {FIX}\not-there
wait 900
mark notice
wait 500
menu 900 500
wait 700
mark menu
wait 500
left settings
wait 900
mark settings
wait 500
left settings:close
wait 300
quit
